---
title: Pineapple Egg Nog Punch
author: Mary Arntson
category: Drinks
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@dairy or canned egg nog{2%qts} (chilled)
@canned frozen pineapple juice{1%12-oz}
@water{1%c}
@allspice{1/2%tsp}
@whipped cream
@nutmeg

Chill - when ready to serve, garnish with dollops of whipped cream and sprinkle with nutmeg.
